  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 12",
  "verseCount": 59,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reekusiinda giimiinoodeaba geaw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida bwadeewa geat eemeeda nyiit sagalamnyoojiga ea gooleabi geadiin hean gwayeesha niny ginealangaaschi, “Afura geat aba hamiirayda fuga Farisaayajeega was giimiituunoodeaba geadiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilinyoo eedukuta gajeanung' ghwadaajiit, ghana dea funyaat jea ea mwajeanal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara ng'asheega oobalooli aba jeeda misaneeda, gajeayiiy aba heedeesh, nea gea oomeang'shi aba ghoorajeega gajearukwiida aba iheenga ghoorajeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida miisa gheawalmeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Fuga eaduupcheewi, geayeenyi adoawali fiisu ammu gwanuus saseedean, ama ng'ata ea manda gil nuut ammu gwasiniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydamiin gheang'deang'wa aba dea jea oawala, diita ama nuusiin, ghoamu gwajaksa jeeda duwayda mamiisean; asaha geayeenyi oawala niny! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada udabwaraadaji muut meesheahideawana heelaji iyeenya? Ak ea manda dea jea gwaroosa ASEETA eara akaleala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara buudeesu bea iheengeagwean siyiida sean. Asi adoawali ng'eang'i, ghoang'waaneewi agooga udabwaraadajeega saang'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Masaweega ea gissiheawaata Gristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak geayeeshiineegwa gilinyoo ea siida gil nyooh ghamwasan aba madeeda buuneeda, eara niny gayghamwas Orjeeda Siida aba madeeda malaykajeega ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea siida heawanaan aba madeeda buuneeda gajeaheawa niny aba madeeda malaykajeega ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida wassean rugu ng'asheega munyas aba badayda Orjeeda Siida gajeesamsa; nea siida ang'eawi Guroorooda Ghaydit ea majeesamsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama deepa eayaadeagwa ghooriida siinealshacheewa ea fuga ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida ea madeeda gea mideawa gheambalmeeda, ea adoohirbabanyi aba gichea ashaayda ea ng'asheega jea arukuta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba gayghoanaaleagwa Guroorooda Ghaydit gichea arukuta aba damandideani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida sigala meanang'oocheanda dasha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Siyagi aba jeedeaba eemeedida, “Giinealshoocheanda, rukusiina orjeeda iyya gagwalnean haleanjeeda jea dahearan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha niny, “Siida, ghwayiinan ng'eaha doaw siichea gooheeldooscheegwa ghana siida jea gwalakuuneegwa haleanjeeda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha saawa, “Afura geat aba geawunda gheang'da; aba gideaba eaweega siida manda jeeda haleanjeeda saang'a mideawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwarukuteawa gwarukusa saawa galeega nea gwayeesha, “Ghayi madamnyeamba siisi was meanang'oocheanda ghwaheas muuchi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gooteemshi nea gwayi, ‘Gaydasin naaha aba gideaba mutandeawa heechea dayiin boogeasu?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwayi, ‘Gaydasindunu: gaydanyarjeaweada gijigoongeasu ak geasinyi suuk gea hees; ak gaydayiin boogeasu ea haleanjeedeanyu sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gay dayeesha geaw, Ea jeedeanyu, gindeawi haleanjeeda saang'a miyaasiin iidiing'deaysi geaw aba gweanyeeka saang'a, fuufa, agiischeena, leesheena, ak gihoosani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha ASEETA niny, ‘Rageananeeda! Eaweani geegasa eaweegaang'u; abeeda haleanjeeda iidiiwsi geaw gay gaba ng'eaha?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi nih giduurji siida adiiwiisa geaw gheaseeda, Nea meabarursiina gea ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Adeagana geaw ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha ginealangaaschi, “Asi geayeeshiineegwa, adoodeawiisi eaweegeagwa gajayaaga naaha, ea gichea ookwealana sasanuukeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba eaweega ghwalaabwa hoowa hamita ak eara saseeda ghwalaabwa hoowa hang'weaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula udaghuuh: mahisiida nea malacha, ea mandeawana gijigoonga, ghana gudihoojiga ak ghoarear ASEETA saawa. Ghoang'waaneewi agooga muuchi dariidaka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eaha aba agooga ammu goodeawiit geaw ak ghoahat geawunda eaweagaaschi eara ea geatinagi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iimoamuusi eara ng'asheanda mwanang'; ghwasaan anda gooneayi geat aba ng'asheega suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'ula deakghweeda gidabuwaanda; ea magadiydooschi nea mamanmana; ak geayeeshiineegwa, eara Sulemani aba jeeda baruureagaaschi sean miigookwealsheata deakghweeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iyakwealsheesiindunu ASEETA deakghweeda madameega mida askweareani ama numuji ea sihisa jeeda duwayda, heapi maygwasineegwa muuchi agooga, ea fuga manang'i masawi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi adoodeawiichi iheengeagwa aba gasooda gichea ayaaga ghana gichea oaleaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba eemoojiga muunda ng'eanyiida gagaseadayi haleanjeeni; ak ghwanal Ghweandeang'wa gideaba googasayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyo ghanyi agassa sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA ak suh abeeda gajeehoaneegwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meanang'oocheanduumeeda humng'eeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adoabeali agoogeeda ng'ay, aba gideaba gagasa Ghweandeang'wa gideaba gahaguuw gagooneegwa sugoocheanduumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashaayda haleanjeeda oondeawi ak ghoataydi haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda; asisina geat shageeniga mawoosiita, gheaseeda mayghoashoay aba humng'eeda heeda may gwaneekiisa mareanghweanda, heeda mayghwaak eara muguyga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba heeda mida gheaseadaang'u heechea goobiida gurooroadaang'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Soomjooga ang'wearu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Arada mananuunatkeagwa nea ghoanung' ghwayeat gheaboonyangeagwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awuurjeewana fuga furda siida haw jea gabiikna nyeangiida, aba gideaba iibiigu ak gagulgul gidaghuuta geebay eejeasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'wana soomjoogiga hita ghweanda nyaawa nea ghoang'wearuun; aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa, gaygwaradiischi ak gagooneegwa hamita, nea gagadiyeeseegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iihidu bugusta eaweeda ghana beashata, ak ghwahidu nea gwasindunu, abeeda ghang'wana soomjoosu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi anala ng'asheanji, gideaba siida bea gheeda inyeeda gayghwanal damanda jea ghwahina mareanghweanda gayghoang'wearu, mayghamwas gideaba gajeenyarja gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi agooga awoosa hidaat aba gideaba damanda moorarsiini gayghwahidu Orjeeda Siida.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Soomjeanda doabiiwaat ea dea miidoabiiwaat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Betaro, “Ng'utamiida, ng'asheesu iigali geadiin girukuneasa aseasa ak ghwahidi ghana irukusi eara buuneesean?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Ng'utamiida, “Gajea ng'eaha gil was haghweadoocheanda doabiiwaat biissa ea bwaraawuh, jea ghoahaaghwa gheanyi nea ghoadaw siida haw goombal, ak ghoadaw buuneeda gichea ghwaak aba damandaanyiin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'wana soomjeanda jea gabiigu siida haw ak ghwahiita nea gwasindunuun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa gayghwanung' goombal haleanjeadaanyi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama eesha geaw soomjeandida aba jeadaanyi, ‘nishing'da siida haw aba hinnooda,’ ak ghoang'eat bayiiga soomjeandideani was headiga ea gadeemga, ak gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi ak gaboogit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaygabiigu siidida haw bea soomjeandida eaweeda mararsiina ea damanda mwanala. Gayghwaaga ghoorjooda ak ghwayiin hijagi sea fuga miidoobiiweadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea soomjeanda nal gidabwariiy siida hawiin ak ea mwang'aabwa geaw nea masina gidasibwariiyiin, gajeabwar muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siidida mwanalaan ak gwasin gida miisa bayiigean, gajeabwar gil mwanang'. Gilinyoo eataw gea saang'a aba headaanyi gajeegasa gea saang'a nea dea siitaw ghoahaaghwa gea saang'a muuchi, aba headaanyi gajeegasa gea saang'a ea ghwanaawda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gweadu dardeayda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aniini ghaawunyi dajaksa beasta jeeda ng'eanyiida; ak gidabal ea ning'ata giiyeeta! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwanda giibaatiisanda miisa gideaba gajeepaatiisanan ea eaghus ea nihit! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga ghoaghanyi gili aawunyi deadu hoyyoo jeeda ng'eanyiida? Manda, Geayeadu dardeayda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghang'eada ghamneawa aba jeeda gheedassagi gaygwanda fih muut dardaawaat samwagu fuurji iyeenya nea gafuurji iyeenya gea asamwagu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gayghwadarda ghweanda ea orjeeda ea orjeeda ea ghwaan, ak ghwadarda gheamata ea huda ea huda ea ghaamwat, nea ghwadarda ghamasiyeeda ea gatmooda orjeeda ea gatmooda orjeeda ea ghamasiyeeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nalooda damanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha eemeeda, “Iyoadaayi shamooghooda aba heeda biyeara, deagheata gooyeenyi ‘Ghwaan roopta’; ak ea huumwa gil ghwahidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa iighuudu jeameeda leabu wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa gooyeenyi, ‘Gayghwaraanya daknooda’; ak gwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 12:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga amiitu geat! Ghoanali arukuni giduurji ng'eanyiida ea humng'eeda ak ea moanaldaniin arukuni damani bea ghamneawean?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.12.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.12.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
